assert(Math.abs(instance.thrown - 97.97) < 0.5);

slintlib.private_api.mock_elapsed_time(200);
assert(Math.abs(instance.thrown - 100.0) < 0.5);
```

```python
# slint-python has no mock-time API (no `slint.testing` module); the
